=== 字符串字面量 ===
Hello, Huzi!

=== 字符串长度 ===
Text: Programming
Length: 11
Empty string length: 0

=== 字符串拼接 ===
Hello, World!
Welcome to Huzi Language!

=== 数值转字符串 ===
Number: 42 -> String: 42
Pi: 3.141590 -> String: 3.141590

=== 复杂字符串操作 ===
foo + bar + baz = foobarbaz

=== 字符串和变量组合 ===
Sum of 10 and 20 is 30
